WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.550
DNA carries the instructions; a gene is a section of DNA.

2
00:00:05.451 --> 00:00:08.401
Zoom in from a person to a single gene.

3
00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:14.035
Nearly every cell has the same DNA, in its nucleus.

4
00:00:17.544 --> 00:00:21.119
A chromosome is one long, coiled DNA molecule.

5
00:00:24.596 --> 00:00:28.496
A gene is a section of DNA: the code for one protein.
